     "head": "Variable window in code",
     "say": "In code, cnt counts each letter inside the window. R adds the new letter. While that letter appears twice, remove the letter at L and step L forward. Now the window has no repeats. Record its length. Each index enters once and leaves once, so O of n. On our string it prints three.",
